        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 207.24,
          "en": "because we don't need scrollability right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 211.2,
          "en": "And we also don't need to generate those items dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 211.2,
          "end": 213.81,
          "en": "Instead, we know exactly how many rows we'll have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 213.81,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "and therefore we're good to go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 220.56,
          "en": "So with that, we can set our child widgets in this column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 220.56,
          "end": 224.16,
          "en": "And I will start with the input field for the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 226.98,
          "en": "of the expense that is about to be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.98,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "And for that we can use the built-in TextField widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 232.32,
          "en": "provided by Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 232.32,
          "end": 235.203,
          "en": "which will display such a text input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 239.25,
          "en": "Flatter has a bunch of built-in input elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 239.25,
          "end": 242.49,
          "en": "For example, later we'll also use the dropdown button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 242.49,
          "end": 244.44,
          "en": "for displaying this dropdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.44,
          "end": 246.84,
          "en": "But here it's TextField for allowing the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.84,
          "end": 248.103,
          "en": "to enter some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.06,
          "end": 252.33,
          "en": "Now the TextField widget has many parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.33,
          "end": 253.83,
          "en": "that can be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.83,
          "end": 258,
          "en": "Many niche parameters, which you will rarely need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258,
          "end": 261.57,
          "en": "but also some very useful parameters like for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.57,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "the max length parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 266.85,
          "en": "which you can use to set a maximum amount of characters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 266.85,
          "end": 269.043,
          "en": "that can be entered into this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 269.91,
          "end": 272.19,
          "en": "For example, here for our expenses, we could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 272.19,
          "end": 275.04,
          "en": "that the title of a single expense shouldn't be longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 275.04,
          "end": 276.84000000000003,
          "en": "than 50 characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 276.84000000000003,
          "end": 279.363,
          "en": "and hence we can enter a value of 50 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.40999999999997,
          "end": 284.90999999999997,
          "en": "In addition, we could also set the keyboard type here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.90999999999997,
          "end": 288,
          "en": "to then use the built-in text input type enum,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288,
          "end": 289.62,
          "en": "which is provided by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 289.62,
          "end": 293.4,
          "en": "to control which virtual keyboard should be opened",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.4,
          "end": 296.43,
          "en": "when the user taps into this text field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 296.43,
          "end": 299.97,
          "en": "So that we, for example, open a keyboard that's optimized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.97,
          "end": 303.87,
          "en": "for entering email addresses or standard text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 303.87,
          "end": 306.03,
          "en": "which is the default setting anyways though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.03,
          "end": 309.12,
          "en": "and which we therefore don't have to set explicitly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 309.12,
          "end": 312.153,
          "en": "And nonetheless, it is important to know about this feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 313.08,
          "end": 316.23,
          "en": "Now here for this text field, I don't need that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 316.23,
          "end": 319.86,
          "en": "but I do want to add a label to the text field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 319.86,
          "end": 323.13,
          "en": "to tell the user which kind of value should be entered there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.13,
          "end": 326.07,
          "en": "so that the user doesn't have to guess.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.07,
          "end": 329.94,
          "en": "And the label can be added and that's a bit strange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 329.94,
          "end": 333.8,
          "en": "by setting the decoration parameter on the text field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.8,
          "end": 336.6,
          "en": "So I guess you can think of this label text as kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 336.6,
          "end": 339.993,
          "en": "of a decoration around the actual text input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.15999999999997,
          "end": 345.72,
          "en": "So decoration then wants a input decoration object created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 345.72,
          "end": 348.24,
          "en": "with the built-in InputDecoration class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.24,
          "end": 349.65,
          "en": "provided by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 349.65,
          "end": 354.18,
          "en": "And InputDecoration offers a label property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 354.18,
          "end": 356.7,
          "en": "So that's how you add a label to a text field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 356.7,
          "end": 360.48,
          "en": "you the decoration parameter to an InputDecoration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 360.48,
          "end": 363.81,
          "en": "And on that object you can set the label property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 363.81,
          "end": 366.96,
          "en": "and the label wants a widget as you can see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 366.96,
          "end": 369.87,
          "en": "So therefore here we can use the Text widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 369.87,
          "end": 373.35,
          "en": "which is the widget you will typically use for such a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 373.35,
          "end": 376.803,
          "en": "to give this text field a label of title, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 378.87,
          "end": 381.09,
          "en": "With all of that, we can add const here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 381.09,
          "end": 383.34,
          "en": "to get rid of the blue squiggly lines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 383.34,
          "end": 386.46,
          "en": "and also add it here in front of EdgeInsets.all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 386.46,
          "end": 389.04,
          "en": "And we should have such a text field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 389.04,
          "end": 391.56,
          "en": "Now, this is not the final form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 391.56,
          "end": 393.27,
          "en": "We'll add more to it later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 393.27,
          "end": 395.88,
          "en": "And at the moment, we're also not handling any input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
